{"product_id":"ripley-under-ground","title":"Ripley Under Ground","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Buckmaster Gallery is staging another Derwatt exhibition, but now an American collector claims that the expensive masterpiece he bought three years ago is a fake. It is, of course, and he wants to talk to Derwatt, but Derwatt, inconveniently, is dead.  Ripley needs the perfect solution to keep his role in the fraud a secret and his reputation clean but not everyone's nerves are as steady as his. Especially when it comes to murder...\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Patricia Highsmith\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780099283584\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 263\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45871445770393,"sku":"12RC9780099283584","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/690f087a5ddc8_Ripley_Under_Ground.jpg?v=1762599748","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/ripley-under-ground","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}